---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SoundLab from '../components/SoundLab.astro';
---
<Layout title="音乐" description="Frees Ling 的声音实验、音乐创作与角色印象曲。"><header class="page-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">MUSIC & SOUND</p><h1 class="page-title">有些情绪，<br />比文字更适合被听见。</h1><p class="lede">这里收纳旋律、声音实验和角色印象曲。第一段声音由浏览器实时生成，不会收集任何数据。</p></header><section class="container player-section"><SoundLab /></section><section class="section container music-notes"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORK IN PROGRESS</p><h2 class="section-title">声音档案正在整理</h2></div><div class="music-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>角色印象曲</h3><p>用主题动机、音色和空间感描绘角色。</p></div><em>ARCHIVING</em></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>中文人声实验</h3><p>从旋律、歌词到合成与混音的完整尝试。</p></div><em>EXPERIMENT</em></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>氛围与交互声音</h3><p>让网页也成为一件可以被演奏的乐器。</p></div><em>LIVE</em></article></div></section></Layout>
<style>.player-section{padding-bottom:100px}.music-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:80px}.music-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.music-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40px 1fr auto;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.music-list span,.music-list em{color:var(--ink-faint);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-style:normal}.music-list h3{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:500}.music-list p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--ink-soft)}@media(max-width:760px){.music-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.music-list article{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr}.music-list em{display:none}}</style>
